WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:17.446
A security guard stood inside True Savings Bank.

2
00:00:17.447 --> 00:00:25.659
He looked at his watch. "It's time to open the bank."

3
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:29.834
He unlocked the door and pushed it open.

4
00:00:29.835 --> 00:00:33.084
Several large figures stood in the entrance.

5
00:00:33.085 --> 00:00:36.004
"Arr!" one figure growled.

6
00:00:36.005 --> 00:00:41.103
"Give us all your loot!"

7
00:00:41.104 --> 00:00:42.375
"It's this way."

8
00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:46.271
Jack was looking at his phone. "Follow me!"

9
00:00:46.272 --> 00:00:50.557
Roxy and her friends were on a scavenger hunt.

10
00:00:50.558 --> 00:00:53.586
Jack was using his phone to locate a box.

11
00:00:53.587 --> 00:00:57.674
Someone had hidden the box in Metro City Park.

12
00:00:57.675 --> 00:01:01.158
"What do you think will be in the box?" Mara asked.

13
00:01:01.159 --> 00:01:04.103
"I hope it's something cool," Terrell said.

14
00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:07.219
"Maybe the box is filled with candy!"

15
00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:11.733
"I hope it's treasure!" Jack said, still looking down at his phone.

16
00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:17.352
"Now we need to turn right."

17
00:01:17.353 --> 00:01:20.574
"Treasure would be awesome," Terrell said.

18
00:01:20.575 --> 00:01:22.970
"We'd all be rich!"

19
00:01:22.971 --> 00:01:26.882
Roxy laughed. "I doubt we'll find treasure.

20
00:01:26.883 --> 00:01:29.484
The box will probably just have a note.

21
00:01:29.485 --> 00:01:32.887
And maybe some bird feathers."

22
00:01:32.888 --> 00:01:35.824
Jack turned onto a path.

23
00:01:35.825 --> 00:01:39.539
He looked closely at his phone as he walked.

24
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.831
Mara gave him a worried look.

25
00:01:41.832 --> 00:01:44.725
"Watch where you're walking, Jack. You might—"

26
00:01:44.726 --> 00:01:47.422
"Oof!" Jack tripped over a tree root.

27
00:01:47.423 --> 00:01:50.392
The phone flew out of his hand as he fell.

28
00:01:50.393 --> 00:01:52.875
He sat up and grinned at Mara.

29
00:01:52.876 --> 00:01:58.141
"I might . . . trip over something?"

30
00:01:58.142 --> 00:02:01.865
Terrell picked up Jack's phone.

31
00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:04.656
"Don't worry. It's not broken."

32
00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:08.320
He handed it back to Jack.

33
00:02:08.321 --> 00:02:11.408
They walked a little farther.

34
00:02:11.409 --> 00:02:13.852
Then Jack stopped and scratched his head.

35
00:02:13.853 --> 00:02:16.443
"I think we went the wrong way."

36
00:02:16.444 --> 00:02:18.226
He groaned as he looked at his phone.

37
00:02:18.227 --> 00:02:21.552
"This map doesn't make any sense."

38
00:02:21.553 --> 00:02:25.097
"It's too bad Rocket Girl isn't here," Terrell said.

39
00:02:25.098 --> 00:02:28.109
"I bet she could find the box really fast!"

40
00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:31.525
He stared at Roxy. "Right, Roxy?"

41
00:02:31.526 --> 00:02:37.023
Roxy gulped. "Uh-oh," she thought. "I think he knows!"

42
00:02:37.024 --> 00:02:42.296
Mara laughed. "Rocket Girl has better things to do, Terrell."

43
00:02:42.297 --> 00:02:44.013
"Yeah," Jack said.

44
00:02:44.014 --> 00:02:47.355
"She's always busy fighting super villains."

45
00:02:47.356 --> 00:02:49.243
Roxy quickly nodded.

46
00:02:49.244 --> 00:02:54.336
"Right! Rocket Girl has, um, other things to do."

47
00:02:54.337 --> 00:02:55.851
Terrell shrugged.

48
00:02:55.852 --> 00:03:01.895
"Maybe. But if she was here, she could definitely find the box for us.

49
00:03:01.896 --> 00:03:06.437
She could use her x-ray vision and see right through everything."

50
00:03:06.438 --> 00:03:09.688
Roxy's watch beeped.

51
00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:14.388
"Oh, I dropped my water bottle somewhere," she said.

52
00:03:14.389 --> 00:03:22.712
"You guys go ahead. I'll catch up to you."

53
00:03:22.713 --> 00:03:27.197
Roxy pressed a button on her watch.

54
00:03:27.198 --> 00:03:30.150
"Mayor Bloom. What's wrong?"

55
00:03:30.151 --> 00:03:32.316
"Rocket Girl," the mayor said.

56
00:03:32.317 --> 00:03:35.026
"True Savings Bank was just robbed.

57
00:03:35.027 --> 00:03:37.176
We need your help!"

58
00:03:37.177 --> 00:03:38.815
Roxy nodded.

59
00:03:38.816 --> 00:03:43.764
"You can count on me, Mayor!"
